The camera performs a slow cinematic dolly movement through the office, revealing multiple agents collaborating professionally. Transparent holographic energy graphs, digital data streams, and subtle glowing blue interface elements float naturally around the workspace without covering people&#x27;s faces. Large digital wall screens display animated electricity network maps and clean dashboard visualizations.

Realistic reflections, soft depth of field, volumetric lighting, premium corporate atmosphere, ultra-photorealistic, 4K HDR, smooth motion, modern business aesthetic, seamless looping animation, no text, no logos, no watermark, no UI elements in foreground, perfect for a professional website hero background.</p></div></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><button type="button" class="pointer-events-auto flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/40 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-50 size-10 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-black/35 text-white backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-black/55" aria-label="Retry" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-5 shrink-0 h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg?v=f5ed3491#retry"></use></svg></button><a aria-label="Reprompt" class="pointer-events-auto inline-flex min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/40 h-10 rounded-full bg-white px-4 text-black text-sm hover:bg-white/90" href="/library?remix=19bf7e5c-0095-44b7-bd98-ac3a8be7a04c"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg?v=f5ed3491#reprompt"></use></svg><span class="truncate">Reprompt</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div><div id="generation-card-8f7a485a-07c2-420d-9e60-78f190fe8a78" class="group/card relative flex flex-col w-full motion-safe:animate-cardEnter motion-safe:[animation-delay:calc(var(--stagger)*55ms)]" style="--s1:57;--s2:29;--s3:19;--s4:15;--s5:12;--s6:10;--s7:9;--stagger:2"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[.875rem] has-[[data-card-preview]:focus-visible]:ring-2 has-[[data-card-preview]:focus-visible]: